### Passed Test Cases
1. |Case|:**registration**
```pseudocode
FUNCTION register()
    IF request.method IS POST THEN
        username = request.form['username']
        password = request.form['password']
        
        IF user_manager.register(username, password) THEN
            RETURN redirect(url_for('login'))
        ELSE
            RETURN "Registration failed. Username already exists."
        ENDIF
    ENDIF

    RETURN render_template('registration.html')
END FUNCTION
```

2. |Case|:**view_bookmarks**
```
FUNCTION bookmarks()
    IF 'username' exists in session
        CALL get_bookmarks(username)
        RENDER bookmarks.html with bookmarks
    ELSE
        REDIRECT to login
    ENDIF
END FUNCTION

FUNCTION get_bookmarks(username)
    bookmarks = []
    TRY
        OPEN 'bookmarks.txt' in read mode
        FOR EACH line in file
            SPLIT line by ','
            IF user matches username
                ADD title to bookmarks
            ENDIF
        END FOR
    EXCEPT FileNotFoundError
        PASS
    RETURN bookmarks
END FUNCTION
```

3. |Case|:**view_story_details**
```
FUNCTION story_details(title)
    story = FIND story IN story_manager.stories WHERE story.title is title
    IF story IS NOT None
        RENDER story_details.html with story
    ELSE
        RENDER error or redirect
    ENDIF
END FUNCTION
```

4. |Case|:**explore_stories**
```
FUNCTION dashboard()
    stories = story_manager.stories
    RENDER dashboard.html with stories
END FUNCTION
```

